  (49, "Dip, Feed, Fell, Raise, Set — all these words are :", "Causative verb", ["Transitive verb", "Intransitive verb", "Causative verb", "Factitive verb"], "c",
   "Causative verb - প্রযোজক ক্রিয়া", "Dive->Dip, Eat->Feed, Fall->Fell, Rise->Raise, Sit->Set এগুলো Causative verb এর রূপ।", "JU 06-07"),
