  (64, "The structure of the following sentence is: They made Karim the captain.", "subject+verb+object +complement", ["subject + verb + object", "subject+verb+object +complement", "subject + verb + object + object", "subject+verb+complement+adverb"], "b",
   "Sentence pattern - S + V + O + C", "They (S) + made (V) + Karim (O) + the captain (C) = S + V + O + C।", "বহিরাগমন ও পাসপোর্ট-১৪"),
